{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107397","id":2583563167,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Z_guf","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107397","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107397.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107397.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107397","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107397/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107397/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107397/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/aae51963ef6dc4ca5b471990dce29c09abaa3adf","number":107397,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash when `save_on_focus_loss` is enabled","user":{"login":"daniel080400","id":26960237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTYwMjM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26960237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400","html_url":"https://github.com/daniel080400","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniel080400/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #107363\r\n\r\nAt 4.4.1, the save scene progress bar will be created when calling ```EditorNode::_save_scene_with_preview()```, which is triggered when Godot is on focus and scene is saved. On the other hand, ```interface/editor/save_on_focus_loss``` will trigger call ```EditorNode::_save_scene()```, which does not create a progress bar.\r\n\r\nBut after the PR #102313, ```EditorNode::_save_scene_with_preview()``` is removed, and progress bar creation is moved to ```_save_scene()```, which causes a infinite loop when ```interface/editor/save_on_focus_loss``` is true:\r\n1. Editor lost focus\r\n2. ```NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_FOCUS_OUT``` is emitted\r\n3. ```EditorNode::_save_scene()``` is called\r\n4. ```ProgressDialog::_update_ui()``` is called\r\n5. ```Main::iteration()``` is called and notification is emitted again, back to step 2.\r\n\r\n```ProgressDialog::_update_ui()``` calls ```Main::iteration()``` directly, this is the root cause of this infinite loop. I'm not sure why ```NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_FOCUS_OUT``` isn't a one-shot event, but the debugger shows that it never stops notifying.\r\n\r\nThis PR creates a new argument ```bool show_progress``` for ```_save_scene()```, and skip creating progress bar if it is False.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/re